# what tools/metal-run.sh gives this phone (docs/porting/index.md). Metal does not apply here: the A51's GPU is a Mali-G72,
# hakios-metal only knows Adreno 0x06030500. The window server would stay on software rendering.
# Big cores are the four Cortex-A73s (MPIDR 0x100-0x103); the panel is 1080x2400 at 60 Hz.
fb_hz=60 fb_threads=3
